---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

import Github from "../assets/github.svg";
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <h1>The Refactored Life</h1>
  <p>
    Welcome to The Refactored Life. My name is John, and I'm currently working
    as a software engineer. I'm using this website to practice my writing. I
    plan to talk about topics like programming, philosophy, and exercise. I may
    talk about books I'm reading or even video games I'm playing. I hope you get
    something valuable from what you find written here. Cheers.
  </p>

  <div class="icon-row">
    <a href="https://github.com/programmer4285">
      <Github width={32} height={32} />
    </a>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .icon-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
